(6035700, 887018, 40391, '<td valign="top">At first glance I didn''t like the heavy handed pp. I love the people you have captured and the more I look at it the more I like the processing. I now feel it''s only a tad overdone (for my taste).  I''m not sure if the tilt was intentional or missed. I would liked to have seen this without tilt or a bit more. Overall, I like this - 8</td>', 'At first glance I didn''t like the heavy handed pp. I love the people you have captured and the more I look at it the more I like the processing. I now feel it''s only a tad overdone (for my taste).  I''m not sure if the tilt was intentional or missed. I would liked to have seen this without tilt or a bit more. Overall, I like this - 8', '2010-06-01 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
