(6038263, 886582, 85310, '<td valign="top">Bumping up a notch on second viewing. I''m not fussy about the borders at top and bottom, but I quite like the composition and exposure on the picture.</td>', 'Bumping up a notch on second viewing. I''m not fussy about the borders at top and bottom, but I quite like the composition and exposure on the picture.', '2010-06-02 21:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
