(6038269, 886791, 85310, '<td valign="top">I like the atmosphere that is captured here, but I think the local contrast and sharpening is a little overdone, particularly on the people at right.</td>', 'I like the atmosphere that is captured here, but I think the local contrast and sharpening is a little overdone, particularly on the people at right.', '2010-06-02 21:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038270, 886898, 85310, '<td valign="top">A nice action shot. You''ve nicely frozen the surfer, but I think it could have been even stronger if you could have used an even shorter shutter speed to freeze the water.</td>', 'A nice action shot. You''ve nicely frozen the surfer, but I think it could have been even stronger if you could have used an even shorter shutter speed to freeze the water.', '2010-06-02 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038277, 886460, 85310, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting a little harsh in this image. I also think the partially out of focus earthen area at the bottom of the frame also detracts from the image.</td>', 'I find the lighting a little harsh in this image. I also think the partially out of focus earthen area at the bottom of the frame also detracts from the image.', '2010-06-02 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
