(6042452, 886753, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this shot of owner(?) and customer interaction.  I like the B&amp;W processing, good tones. With that said, my only critique would be just a bit more crop on the right side (up to the stack of napkins), but still a great catch.</td>', 'I like this shot of owner(?) and customer interaction.  I like the B&W processing, good tones. With that said, my only critique would be just a bit more crop on the right side (up to the stack of napkins), but still a great catch.', '2010-06-05 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6042623, 886920, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like your viewpoint. Distant enough to get a broader view, yet close enough to see faces and detail. Your photo also conveys the hustle/bustle of a market and the HDR processing is not over-the-top, although the sky is a bit more dramatic than street level so that I think you processed it<br/>separately.  Nice job, on the whole.</td>', 'I like your viewpoint. Distant enough to get a broader view, yet close enough to see faces and detail. Your photo also conveys the hustle/bustle of a market and the HDR processing is not over-the-top, although the sky is a bit more dramatic than street level so that I think you processed itseparately.  Nice job, on the whole.', '2010-06-06 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6042625, 886655, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice processing, but the composition is a bit haphazard, imo.</td>', 'Nice processing, but the composition is a bit haphazard, imo.', '2010-06-06 01:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
