(6044496, 886095, 60047, '<td valign="top">Steve,<br/> <br/>I really thought you captured a great shot, here. Upon first glance, I was impressed and surprised with the larger and more noticeable texture in the concrete - but I wonder if some mistook it for graininess? Also, I guess the score might have suffered from those not familiar with what a recognizable attraction destination these water gardens are for the city of Fort Worth.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing a more staged shot with a model might have had more of the "WOW" you are looking for. But still, I thought this was good work.</td>', 'Steve, I really thought you captured a great shot, here. Upon first glance, I was impressed and surprised with the larger and more noticeable texture in the concrete - but I wonder if some mistook it for graininess? Also, I guess the score might have suffered from those not familiar with what a recognizable attraction destination these water gardens are for the city of Fort Worth. I''m guessing a more staged shot with a model might have had more of the "WOW" you are looking for. But still, I thought this was good work.', '2010-06-07 08:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6044499, 886786, 57229, '<td valign="top">Grazie, Rino...</td>', 'Grazie, Rino...', '2010-06-07 08:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
