(6045659, 886850, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats!<br/> <br/>The tripod thing isn''t about security; they charge professional crews (think movie studios) to get a permit to use tripods.<br/> <br/>Also, it''s such a photogenic system, imagine if 40 people set up tripods - quite the traffic blocker.<br/> <br/>As far as simply taking pics, I''ve had cops and station managers ask me what I''m up to.  I happily show them my results and say I''m an amateur photographer, and they''ve never bothered me beyond that.</td>', 'Congrats! The tripod thing isn''t about security; they charge professional crews (think movie studios) to get a permit to use tripods. Also, it''s such a photogenic system, imagine if 40 people set up tripods - quite the traffic blocker. As far as simply taking pics, I''ve had cops and station managers ask me what I''m up to.  I happily show them my results and say I''m an amateur photographer, and they''ve never bothered me beyond that.', '2010-06-07 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
