(6046101, 886881, 110400, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  I am a bit disappointed that this one didn''t do better.  I know some of the low votes were probably because the challenge was "Life in Your City" and this seems pretty country.  This is actually a church just on the outskirts of town near where I live and describes the feel of a small town with high regard for moral values.<br/> <br/>To those who think this is over-processed, I agree.  I left my circular polarizer on and it caught the light streaming down from the clouds, but left some additional problem areas that required some extra processing.  I didn''t add the light through the clouds, that was already there and was brought out with the HDR.  <br/> <br/>The angled road was a tough decision for me.  I straightened it twice and then went back and forth for a while trying to decide.  In the end, I went with the steeple being straight and the road being crooked instead of the other way around and cropping that close would have messed the whole thing up.<br/> <br/>I just want to thank everyone who voted high for it and it still amazes me that there are people who feel the need to vote 2 and 3 for a picture like this.  Is this really a 2 picture?  That''s like saying this picture sucked so bad it wasn''t worth the storage space it took to put it together.<br/> <br/>Listed below are the 5 images I used to put this together.  Throw it all into Photomatix and bring it up to visible and all the light from the clouds just comes right to the front.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889513" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889513.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889513.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889513.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889514" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889514.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889514.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889514.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889515" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889515.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889515.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889515.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889516" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889516.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889516.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889516.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=889517" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889517.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889517.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/110400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_889517.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  I am a bit disappointed that this one didn''t do better.  I know some of the low votes were probably because the challenge was "Life in Your City" and this seems pretty country.  This is actually a church just on the outskirts of town near where I live and describes the feel of a small town with high regard for moral values. To those who think this is over-processed, I agree.  I left my circular polarizer on and it caught the light streaming down from the clouds, but left some additional problem areas that required some extra processing.  I didn''t add the light through the clouds, that was already there and was brought out with the HDR.   The angled road was a tough decision for me.  I straightened it twice and then went back and forth for a while trying to decide.  In the end, I went with the steeple being straight and the road being crooked instead of the other way around and cropping that close would have messed the whole thing up. I just want to thank everyone who voted high for it and it still amazes me that there are people who feel the need to vote 2 and 3 for a picture like this.  Is this really a 2 picture?  That''s like saying this picture sucked so bad it wasn''t worth the storage space it took to put it together. Listed below are the 5 images I used to put this together.  Throw it all into Photomatix and bring it up to visible and all the light from the clouds just comes right to the front.     ', '2010-06-08 02:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
